  "description": "RURVIK crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C190 H195 Ho5 O45,4(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho1A (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho2A (Ho) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.514-5.090 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.90-161.04°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C190H195Ho5O45·4C7H8. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
